L50: # 2026 General Election
L51: 
L52: September 10, 2026
L53: 
L54: Courthouse Hours are 8:00 AM - 5:00 PM
L55: ## General Election
L56: 
L57: 2026 General Election is Tuesday, November 3, 2026
L58: 
L59: October 19, 2026 - Voter Pre-registration Deadline; Last day to request a ballot to be mailed to a voter
L60: 
L61: October 31, 2026 - Auditor’s Office open (9:00 AM-5:00 PM)
L62: 
L63: November 2, 2026 - Last day to vote absentee in the Auditor's Office
L64: 
L65: November 3, 2026 - Election Day (7:00 AM-8:00 PM)
L66: 
L67: November 9, 2026 - Provisional ballots can be cured by NOON in the Auditor's Office
L68: 
L69: November 10, 2026 - Canvass the Election
